    {
      "id": "types",
      "seconds": 14.9,
      "heading": "Types, checked before it runs",
      "narration": "The four older languages check types as the program runs. {X_eTaL|@xtl} infers a type for every function first. The mean takes integers, and gives a float. A program that gives it floats is rejected before it runs.",
      "lines": [],
      "panel": {
        "type": "code",
        "lines": [
