    {
      "id": "counts",
      "seconds": 33.3,
      "heading": "How many built-ins",
      "narration": "How many built-ins does each one have. {APL|@apl} has fifty six function glyphs, and twenty two operators. {J|Jay} spells about a hundred and eighteen, all in {ASCII|ass key}. {K|Kay} has just twenty two verbs and six adverbs, but most mean several things. {BQN|@bqn} has forty four functions, and twenty modifiers. {X_eTaL|@xtl} has seventy five functions, mostly words, and eleven higher order functions in place of operators.",
